      "text": "the Lord tries his people’s patience and faith, Mosiah 23:21 (3 Ne. 26:11). Mosiah2 unfolds trials of righteous king, Mosiah 29:33. contention is cause of much trial with Church, Alma 1:22–23. Ammon2 and brethren will try Nephites’ hearts, whether converted Lamanites should enter land, Alma 27:15. Alma2 to try virtue of word of God, Alma 31:5. try experiment by planting seed, Alma 32:36 (34:4). whosoever puts trust in God will be supported in trials, Alma 36:3 (38:5). Lamanites to receive account of the Savior’s teachings to try their faith, 3 Ne. 26:9. ye receive no witness until after trial of faith, Ether 12:6.",
